  "note": "Opening the Collectors Guild on the live Habbo hotel. The point of this capture is the ORDER: seven requests go out with no arguments, and the four that carry the stardust wallet cannot be sent until CollectibleWalletAddresses has come back. Header ids are AIR-1.0.31's and differ from the emulator's target build, so only the order and the structures are evidence here. CAVEAT ON PAIRING: the hotel answers asynchronously and the two directions are interleaved, so a server message here is NOT a reply to the request printed above it. Any request-to-response pairing derived from this file by position is an artefact of the file, not of Habbo -- the three behaviour conflicts it raises (GetNftStoreOffers -> CollectibleWalletAddresses, GetCollectorScore -> the five answers that follow it, GetNftClaims -> NftStoreOffers) are all of that kind and none of them is a disagreement with this emulator.",
